  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5c8f34dd-662b-4244-b87c-5e4686e27547.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"165\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_22fecc8b-c175-41ae-ad03-3a10ef0a7e71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b04d0564-3d92-45ac-8b14-7fe906612dee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">低地服裝與盔甲是一個為 Minecraft 帶來一系列新盔甲的模組。它以奇幻/黑暗奇幻為主題，靈感來自各種熱門作品。該模組也添加了一些製作物品所需的新資源。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">如果你喜歡我的模組，可以考慮在 Patreon 上支持我：&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249421/description_872a60a5-8946-4466-9be7-a2bf9eb53996.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/golden_obituary_games\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/cw/golden_obituary_games</a></strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5979eb43-cb8d-43b2-805c-de5d0986b12a.png\" width=\"178\" height=\"35\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b04d0564-3d92-45ac-8b14-7fe906612dee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>十種新盔甲，包括：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-守衛隊長盔甲：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0b456db0-cd18-4dcc-b2af-3796301c014f.png\" width=\"779\" height=\"409\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-傭兵劍士盔甲：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_372d102d-b0ac-4d29-9c65-220040d556d3.png\" width=\"783\" height=\"411\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><img>-山地人服裝：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9047fed3-3ca3-4ab0-b2d7-31d0cf55e7ff.png\" width=\"783\" height=\"411\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-雪虎盔甲：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8354ee15-3137-4e77-9513-d81c4a7f2f6e.png\" width=\"785\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-捕鼠人套裝：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4a6b0396-cf7c-4032-82f6-838bae673f58.png\" width=\"785\" height=\"412\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-劊子手盔甲：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7deeb4a5-72b1-4d2e-a227-a8f87435e209.png\" width=\"789\" height=\"414\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>-鍛造大師盔甲：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20e8d689-83f5-43f2-bd44-18974b6fc0e4.png\" width=\"792\" height=\"416\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">以及更多……</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">該模組還添加了基本資源，如處理過的皮革、植物纖維和其他物品，以及一隻灰熊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">感謝 Star Walker 提供的韓文翻譯！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">感謝閱讀，祝遊戲愉快！ :D</span></p>",
